# --- Agent scaffolding (local only) -------------------------------------------
# The graphify knowledge graph, the Obsidian vault exported from it, and the
# per-tool agent configs are working aids for coding agents, not product code.
# They live on the developer's machine; a fresh clone recreates the graph with
# `graphify update .` and the vault with `graphify export obsidian`.
